lted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 9264, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011ieuwfWxbvnkxWL3XNmKaE", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 9264, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Qxki8pSYEr8qvuvHYXS5c3", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 9564, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Qxki8pSYEr8qvuvHYXS5c3", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 9564, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Qxki8pSYEr8qvuvHYXS5c3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 11490, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01WvhhG2fRvEeGwZVJ9iJXVs", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 11790, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01WvhhG2fRvEeGwZVJ9iJXVs", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 11790, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WvhhG2fRvEeGwZVJ9iJXVs", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 14713, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01SVcxsKY4Hay6bBzByuKzuN", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 18713, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01SVcxsKY4Hay6bBzByuKzuN", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18713, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01SVcxsKY4Hay6bBzByuKzuN", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20374, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01D59DgdW4rj1aVNRxSZGGiQ", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20674, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01D59DgdW4rj1aVNRxSZGGiQ", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20674, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01D59DgdW4rj1aVNRxSZGGiQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25297, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01HVBSYnf9izpsc9xLNCRBuN", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After v2.3.1 was deployed, checkout-api failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on different versions (us-east v2.3.0; us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). A second attempt completed in all regions. After the rollback, all regions run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failures (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging) and investigate the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55897, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HVBSYnf9izpsc9xLNCRBuN", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55897, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HVBSYnf9izpsc9xLNCRBuN", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57398, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012mNpASwacBPpKC4vqeSGVp", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57698, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012mNpASwacBPpKC4vqeSGVp", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57698, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012mNpASwacBPpKC4vqeSGVp", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62425, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened a SEV2 incident for it.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1, the one now failing, was also unhealthy as a release candidate in staging.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, which left the other two regions on v2.3.1. I checked that state, then ran the rollback once more and it finished.\n- Now: us-east, us-west and eu-west all run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) is open and has paged on-call. It covers the failure, the rollback (including the first attempt stopping partway) and next steps: finding the cause of the v2.3.1 failures and why the first rollback stopped.\n- The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again, and it had been created, so there's only one.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KpXfY6xZM1K2Rmhdn3MvN3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01H68t4uRL6WWuA6kY6gi9ip", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011ieuwfWxbvnkxWL3XNmKaE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Qxki8pSYEr8qvuvHYXS5c3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WvhhG2fRvEeGwZVJ9iJXVs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to a fixed version is safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01SVcxsKY4Hay6bBzByuKzuN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01D59DgdW4rj1aVNRxSZGGiQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01HVBSYnf9izpsc9xLNCRBuN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After v2.3.1 was deployed, checkout-api failed health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on different versions (us-east v2.3.0; us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). A second attempt completed in all regions. After the rollback, all regions run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failures (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging) and investigate the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_012mNpASwacBPpKC4vqeSGVp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened a SEV2 incident for it.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1, the one now failing, was also unhealthy as a release candidate in staging.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, which left the other two regions on v2.3.1. I checked that state, then ran the rollback once more and it finished.\n- Now: us-east, us-west and eu-west all run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) is open and has paged on-call. It covers the failure, the rollback (including the first attempt stopping partway) and next steps: finding the cause of the v2.3.1 failures and why the first rollback stopped.\n- The request to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again, and it had been created, so there's only one.", "type": "text"}]}]}